                                "sense_id": "088fb356-df79-3b6a-aac3-22faeeeb3695",
                                "text": "\"Upo' the hill\" the callan cries, \"She cock'd her gaucy runt; An' to Strathfallan green Burn-brae, Fu' nimbly she did strunt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d317f65-5496-41cd-86b1-2a036cdd109d",
                                "sense_id": "088fb356-df79-3b6a-aac3-22faeeeb3695",
                                "text": "High were their hopes for food and cash, And drink to keep them strunting, Which cures the yisk and waterbrash, And sets the pipe a lunting"
                            },
